eering effort but uses common web technologies.\n\nAcceptability (1-4): degree to which idea is socially, legally, politically acceptable.\nCommon strategies that violate no norms. Acceptability 4.\n\nEvidence: Visualization for compliance monitoring is conventional and raises no legal or ethical concerns.\n\nReturn rating echo id.\n\nFormat: need <subscale>_evidence then <subscale>. Probably each line.\n\nLet's output JSON? Probably plain text.\n\nProvide:\n\nid P1075\neffectiveness_evidence: ...\neffectiveness: 3\n...\n\nEnsure order listed: effectiveness, applicability, originality, paradigm_relatedness, implementability, acceptability\n\nDo that.\n\n",
