ld be 2 = significant change, expensive/difficult but not totally impossible. Research project is maybe moderate cost. Probably 3. Evidence: Running experiments with sketching and compressed sensing requires engineering effort but uses existing techniques.\n\nAcceptability: degree to which idea is socially, legally, politically acceptable. 4 = common strategies that violate no norms. This is research on logging compliance, acceptable. 4. Evidence: Developing efficient logging supports regulatory compliance and transparency norms without violating laws or sensibilities.\n\nProvide output with id and each subscale evidence then score.\n\nNeed format: echo id exactly. For each subscale give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first then \"<subscale>\" integer.\n\nProbably JSON? Probably list. Provide as lines.\n\nI'll output JSON object with id, effectiveness_evidence, effectiveness, etc.\n\nLet's produce.\n\n",
